 per 100,000 population\"}]}, {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"In 2019, the first peak occurred during week 28 (mid-July), 3 weeks earlier than the mean first peak during 2004–2018\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The vector index is calculated by determining the average number of infected mosquitoes collected per trap in an area\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Cases were classified according to the national WNV surveillance case definition\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}